---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Prepare for your interview"
description: "Practice for an SCG interview: sample behavioral questions with a timer, the STAR method, and SCG's case framework guide and practice cases to download."
bodyClass: page-prepare
---
{#- Prepare (SPEC 5.5). The three sample questions are the old Interview Resources page's;
    the hints are general interview advice, not facts about SCG. Downloads come from
    site.json → downloads and only render for files that exist in assets/downloads/. -#}
{%- from "components/ui.njk" import tbdBlock with context -%}
{%- from "components/page-banner.njk" import pageBanner with context -%}
{%- set questions = [
  { q: "Tell me about yourself.",
    hints: ["Present: who you are now, your major and what you are working on.", "Past: one or two experiences that explain how you got here.", "Future: why SCG, and what you want to learn next.", "Keep it to about a minute and a half."],
    link: null },
  { q: "Can you tell me about a time when you were on a team and faced conflict or disagreement on a project? How did you approach resolving the issue, and what was the outcome?",
    hints: ["Use STAR: Situation, Task, Action, Result.", "Spend most of your time on your own actions, and say “I”, not only “we”.", "Show that you listened and understood the other view.", "End with the outcome and what you would do the same or differently."],
    link: null },
  { q: "Which client that SCG has worked with in the past interests you the most? Is there anything you are curious to learn about that project?",
    hints: ["Pick one project and name the client's challenge in a sentence.", "Explain why it interests you: a skill you have, or one you want to build.", "Ask a real question about it, such as how the team approached one deliverable."],
    link: { label: "Browse projects to answer this one", url: "/projects/" } }
] -%}

{{ pageBanner({ id: "prep-title", title: "Prepare for your interview", lede: "Practice the sample questions out loud, time yourself, and read SCG's own case guides.", before: '<nav class="breadcrumbs page-banner__crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/join/">Join SCG</a></li><li aria-current="page">Prepare</li></ol></nav>' }) }}

<section class="section section--paper-2" aria-labelledby="practice-title">
  <div class="container practice">
    <header class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Practice room</p>
      <h2 class="section__title" id="practice-title">Sample behavioral questions</h2>
      <p class="section__lede">Read a question, answer it out loud, then reveal a structure to check your answer.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="practice__layout">
      <div class="deck" data-deck>
        <div class="deck__bar" data-deck-bar hidden>
          <p class="deck__pos" data-deck-pos aria-live="polite"></p>
          <button class="btn btn--sm btn--secondary" type="button" data-deck-shuffle>Shuffle</button>
        </div>
        <ol class="deck__cards">
          {%- for item in questions %}
          <li class="qcard" data-card id="q-{{ loop.index }}">
            <p class="qcard__num">Question {{ loop.index }}</p>
            <h3 class="qcard__q">{{ item.q }}</h3>
            <div class="qcard__hints" id="q-{{ loop.index }}-hints" data-card-hints>
              <h4 class="qcard__hints-title">A structure that works</h4>
              <ul class="checklist">{% for h in item.hints %}<li>{{ h }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
            </div>
            <div class="qcard__actions">
              <button class="btn btn--sm btn--primary" type="button" data-card-reveal aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="q-{{ loop.index }}-hints" hidden>Show answer structure</button>
              {%- if item.link %}<a class="link-arrow" href="{{ item.link.url }}">{{ item.link.label }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>{% endif %}
            </div>
          </li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ol>
        {#- With JS the arrows are moved into the visible card's footer (right side). -#}
        <div class="deck__nav" data-deck-nav hidden>
          <button class="icon-btn" type="button" data-deck-prev aria-label="Previous question"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5l-7 7 7 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
          <button class="icon-btn" type="button" data-deck-next aria-label="Next question"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="timer" data-timer hidden aria-labelledby="timer-title">
        <h3 class="timer__title" id="timer-title">Practice timer</h3>
        <p class="timer__hint">Two minutes per answer. No sound.</p>
        <div class="timer__dial" style="--progress: 0" aria-hidden="true">
          <p class="timer__time" data-timer-time aria-hidden="true">2:00</p>
        </div>
        <p class="visually-hidden" role="status" data-timer-status></p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <button class="btn btn--sm btn--primary" type="button" data-timer-toggle>Start</button>
          <button class="btn btn--sm btn--secondary" type="button" data-timer-reset>Reset</button>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="star-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">A simple framework</p>
      <h2 class="section__title" id="star-title">The STAR method</h2>
      <p class="section__lede">For “tell me about a time when…” questions, walk through four parts in order.</p>
    </header>
    <ol class="star">
      <li class="star__item"><span class="star__letter" aria-hidden="true">S</span><h3 class="star__name">Situation</h3><p>Set the scene in one or two sentences: where you were and what was going on.</p></li>
      <li class="star__item"><span class="star__letter" aria-hidden="true">T</span><h3 class="star__name">Task</h3><p>Your goal or responsibility in that situation.</p></li>
      <li class="star__item"><span class="star__letter" aria-hidden="true">A</span><h3 class="star__name">Action</h3><p>What you did, step by step. This should be the longest part.</p></li>
      <li class="star__item"><span class="star__letter" aria-hidden="true">R</span><h3 class="star__name">Result</h3><p>What happened, with a number if you have one, and what you learned.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

{%- if downloads.length %}
<section class="section section--paper-2" aria-labelledby="downloads-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Case interview prep</p>
      <h2 class="section__title" id="downloads-title">Guides and practice cases</h2>
      <p class="section__lede">SCG's own guides and practice cases. Free to download.</p>
    </header>
    {#- Each card: cover of page 1 (scripts/make-pdf-covers.mjs), text, then Preview (opens the
        built-in viewer; without JS a plain link to the PDF) and Download PDF. -#}
    <ul class="resource-grid doc-grid">
      {%- for d in downloads %}
      <li class="doc-card">
        {%- if d.cover %}
        <div class="doc-card__cover"><img src="{{ d.cover.src }}" width="{{ d.cover.width }}" height="{{ d.cover.height }}" alt="First page of {{ d.title }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
        {%- endif %}
        <div class="doc-card__body">
          <p class="resource-card__kind">{{ d.kind }}</p>
          <h3 class="resource-card__title">{{ d.title }}</h3>
          <p class="resource-card__text">{{ d.description }}</p>
          <p class="resource-card__meta">PDF, {{ d.size }}{% if d.pages %} · {{ d.pages }} pages{% endif %}</p>
          <div class="doc-card__actions">
            <a class="btn btn--sm btn--primary" href="{{ d.url }}" data-pdf-preview="{{ d.slug }}" data-pdf-title="{{ d.title }}" data-pdf-url="{{ d.url }}" data-pdf-size="{{ d.size }}">Preview<span class="visually-hidden">: {{ d.title }}</span></a>
            <a class="btn btn--sm btn--secondary" href="{{ d.url }}" download>Download PDF<span class="visually-hidden">: {{ d.title }}, {{ d.size }}</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
{%- elif env.showPlaceholders %}
<section class="section section--paper-2"><div class="container">{{ tbdBlock("Case guides", "[TBD: case framework PDF, practice cases and SICC prompt (site.json → downloads)]") }}</div></section>
{%- endif %}

{#- Resume guide: the same link as the "Resume guide" card on /join/ (site.json → links.resume_guide).
    Google Slides links are embedded (/embed form); anything else becomes a plain card. The deck
    must be shared "Anyone with the link can view" for the embed to show. -#}
{%- set resumeEmbed = site.links.resume_guide | slidesEmbed %}
{%- if site.links.resume_guide %}
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="resume-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Resume</p>
      <h2 class="section__title" id="resume-title">Resume guide</h2>
      <p class="section__lede">SCG's guide to building a strong resume.</p>
    </header>
    {%- if resumeEmbed %}
    <div class="embed-frame">
      <iframe src="{{ resumeEmbed }}" title="SCG resume guide (Google Slides)" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen
        sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"></iframe>
    </div>
    <p class="embed-frame__link"><a class="link-arrow" href="{{ site.links.resume_guide }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open in a new tab<span class="visually-hidden">: SCG resume guide</span> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
    {%- else %}
    <ul class="resource-grid"><li><a class="resource-card" href="{{ site.links.resume_guide }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="resource-card__kind">Guide</span><span class="resource-card__title">Resume guide</span><span class="resource-card__text">SCG's guide to building a strong resume.</span><span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></li></ul>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}

<section class="section section--paper-2" aria-labelledby="more-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section__head">
      <h2 class="section__title" id="more-title">More ways to prepare</h2>
    </header>
    <ul class="resource-grid">
      <li><a class="resource-card" href="/projects/">
        <span class="resource-card__kind">Explore</span>
        <span class="resource-card__title">Past projects</span>
        <span class="resource-card__text">Client stories from recent semesters, and the skills each team used.</span>
      </a></li>
      <li><a class="resource-card" href="/join/#timeline">
        <span class="resource-card__kind">Recruitment</span>
        <span class="resource-card__title">Recruiting timeline and FAQ</span>
        <span class="resource-card__text">How recruiting works, step by step, and answers to frequently asked questions.</span>
      </a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight cta-strip" aria-labelledby="prep-cta-title">
  <div class="container cta-strip__inner">
    <h2 class="cta-strip__title" id="prep-cta-title">Ready when you are</h2>
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/join/">Back to Join SCG</a>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="{{ '/js/practice.js' | versioned }}" defer></script>

{#- PDF viewer (pdf-viewer.js). PDF.js itself (js/vendor/pdfjs/) is imported only on the first
    Preview click. Same dialog pattern as the project detail dialog. -#}
{%- if downloads.length %}
<dialog class="pdf-viewer" id="pdf-viewer" aria-labelledby="pdf-viewer-title" data-pdf-viewer>
  <div class="pdf-viewer__panel">
    <div class="pdf-viewer__bar">
      <h2 class="pdf-viewer__title" id="pdf-viewer-title" data-pdf-title tabindex="-1"></h2>
      <div class="pdf-viewer__tools">
        <div class="pdf-viewer__group" role="group" aria-label="Pages">
          <button class="icon-btn" type="button" data-pdf-prev aria-label="Previous page"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5l-7 7 7 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
          <span class="pdf-viewer__page" data-pdf-page aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <button class="icon-btn" type="button" data-pdf-next aria-label="Next page"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
        </div>
        <div class="pdf-viewer__group" role="group" aria-label="Zoom">
          <button class="icon-btn" type="button" data-pdf-zoom-out aria-label="Zoom out"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 12h12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button>
          <span class="pdf-viewer__zoom" data-pdf-zoom aria-hidden="true">100%</span>
          <button class="icon-btn" type="button" data-pdf-zoom-in aria-label="Zoom in"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 6v12M6 12h12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn--sm btn--gold pdf-viewer__download" href="#" download data-pdf-download>Download PDF</a>
        <button class="icon-btn" type="button" data-pdf-close aria-label="Close preview"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="visually-hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-pdf-status></p>
    <div class="pdf-viewer__stage" data-pdf-stage>
      <p class="pdf-viewer__loading" data-pdf-loading>Loading preview…</p>
      <div class="pdf-viewer__error" data-pdf-error hidden>
        <p>This preview could not be shown.</p>
        <p><a class="btn btn--sm btn--primary" href="#" download data-pdf-error-link>Download PDF</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="pdf-viewer__page-wrap" data-pdf-wrap hidden>
        <canvas class="pdf-viewer__canvas" data-pdf-canvas aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
        <div class="textLayer" data-pdf-text></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</dialog>
<script src="{{ '/js/pdf-viewer.js' | versioned }}" defer></script>
{%- endif %}
